WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.934 --> 00:00:17.499
It was late at night in Metro City Park.

2
00:00:17.500 --> 00:00:21.650
In the lake the frogs croaked softly.

3
00:00:21.651 --> 00:00:26.216
Suddenly a bright object fell from the sky.

4
00:00:26.217 --> 00:00:28.679
It splashed into the lake.

5
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.174
The water bubbled up and turned purple.

6
00:00:32.175 --> 00:00:36.500
Ribbit! Ribbit!

7
00:00:36.501 --> 00:00:41.375
The next day Roxy and her friends were in the woods in Metro City Park.

8
00:00:41.376 --> 00:00:45.756
"Look at me!" called Terrell from the top of a giant boulder.

9
00:00:45.757 --> 00:00:48.730
"I'm taller than everyone!"

10
00:00:48.731 --> 00:00:52.191
"I'm coming up there!" said Mara.

11
00:00:52.192 --> 00:00:55.889
"Me too!" said Roxy.

12
00:00:55.890 --> 00:00:59.101
The two girls started climbing up.

13
00:00:59.102 --> 00:01:01.527
"Not me," said Jack.

14
00:01:01.528 --> 00:01:04.311
"I don't like high places."

15
00:01:04.312 --> 00:01:07.943
"You're scared of high places?" asked Mara.

16
00:01:07.944 --> 00:01:10.650
"I'm not scared," said Jack.

17
00:01:10.651 --> 00:01:13.895
"I just don't like being high up."

18
00:01:13.896 --> 00:01:17.927
Terrell shrugged. "That's okay," he said.

19
00:01:17.928 --> 00:01:20.276
"I don't like the dark."

20
00:01:20.277 --> 00:01:23.220
"I'm scared of monsters," said Mara.

21
00:01:23.221 --> 00:01:27.096
"Especially ones with fangs!"

22
00:01:27.097 --> 00:01:30.179
"That's not a problem," said Terrell.

23
00:01:30.180 --> 00:01:33.780
"Rocket Girl can protect us from monsters."

24
00:01:33.781 --> 00:01:35.498
He looked at Roxy.

25
00:01:35.499 --> 00:01:38.132
"What are you afraid of, Roxy?"

26
00:01:38.133 --> 00:01:40.383
Just then Mara called out.

27
00:01:40.384 --> 00:01:44.400
"Oh look! I see a frog under those leaves!"

28
00:01:44.401 --> 00:01:49.546
Mara jumped down and picked up the small frog.

29
00:01:49.547 --> 00:01:52.753
Terrell and Jack walked over.

30
00:01:52.754 --> 00:01:56.610
"Eww! Eww!" said Roxy.

31
00:01:56.611 --> 00:01:59.340
"What's wrong?" asked Mara.

32
00:01:59.341 --> 00:02:04.744
"Keep that frog away from me," said Roxy. "Gross!"

33
00:02:04.745 --> 00:02:08.541
"So you're scared of frogs?" said Jack.

34
00:02:08.542 --> 00:02:12.498
"I'm not scared," said Roxy uneasily.

35
00:02:12.499 --> 00:02:15.914
"I just think they're . . . gross."

36
00:02:15.915 --> 00:02:19.631
"Maybe Rocket Girl can help you," said Terrell.

37
00:02:19.632 --> 00:02:22.263
"Help me?" asked Roxy.

38
00:02:22.264 --> 00:02:24.847
"Yeah," said Terrell.

39
00:02:24.848 --> 00:02:28.028
"Help you not to be scared of frogs."

40
00:02:28.029 --> 00:02:31.760
Roxy frowned. "I just said I'm not—"

41
00:02:31.761 --> 00:02:34.601
Ribbit! Ribbit!

42
00:02:34.602 --> 00:02:38.588
"What was that?" asked Jack, looking around.

43
00:02:38.589 --> 00:02:42.064
"It sounded like a frog," said Terrell.

44
00:02:42.065 --> 00:02:44.606
"But it was really loud."

45
00:02:44.607 --> 00:02:48.092
Nearby a tree fell over.

46
00:02:48.093 --> 00:02:52.152
Crack! Another tree crashed down.

47
00:02:52.153 --> 00:03:00.359
Smash! The friends held their breath as a huge creature moved closer.

48
00:03:00.360 --> 00:03:04.763
"It . . . It's a frog!" cried Terrell.

49
00:03:04.764 --> 00:03:08.408
"It's a huge frog!" said Mara.

50
00:03:08.409 --> 00:03:12.227
"It's bigger than a car!" said Jack.

51
00:03:12.228 --> 00:03:18.211
Croak! The giant frog hopped into the air and was gone.

52
00:03:18.212 --> 00:03:20.300
Roxy's face turned pale.

53
00:03:20.301 --> 00:03:24.809
A moment later her watch beeped.

54
00:03:24.810 --> 00:03:27.815
Roxy moved away from her friends.

55
00:03:27.816 --> 00:03:31.824
She pressed a button and Mayor Bloom's face appeared.

56
00:03:31.825 --> 00:03:35.154
"Let me guess, Mayor," whispered Roxy.

57
00:03:35.155 --> 00:03:38.678
"You're calling about the giant frog."

58
00:03:38.679 --> 00:03:42.386
"It's not just one, Rocket Girl!" cried the mayor.

59
00:03:42.387 --> 00:03:44.587
"Giant frogs are everywhere!

60
00:03:44.588 --> 00:03:47.082
They're invading Metro City!

61
00:03:47.083 --> 00:03:53.709
Please do something!"
